<title>USA: Frontier Natural Gas Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Frontier Natural Gas Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								March 31,</p>
<p>							   1997	 1996</p>
<p> Total revenues				   405,647  1,250,206</p>
<p> Net loss					(1,352,022)  (769,226)</p>
<p>Net loss per common and common equivalent share</p>
<p>							  (0.19)     (0.16)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 net loss reflects the sale of most of its mid-continent oil and gas properties and higher exploration costs, including its dry hole in South Louisiana.</p>
<p>Full name is Frontier Natural Gas Corp.</p>
